    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***UNDER OFFER***\r\n\r\n23 O’Connell’s Avenue is a beautifully presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom mid terraced home offering an perfect blend of comfort, security, and convenience. This turnkey property features a modern flat-roof rear extension that intelligently houses a practical utility room, a downstairs bedroom, and a contemporary shower room. The fully enclosed, low-maintenance site is secured by solid block-built boundary walls on all sides, featuring a welcoming set-down front patio and a sun-drenched, south-east facing concrete rear courtyard. \r\n\r\nPerfect for hobbyists or extra storage, the property boasts two generous-sized block-built lock-up stores to the rear.  Complete with oil-fired central heating and all mains services, this immaculate home sits just a short stroll from local shops, schools, and restaurants while offering rapid access to the local greenway and the Listowel Bypass connecting you to Limerick, Tarbert and Tralee.  \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised.  Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers on 068 21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.0m x 1.2m \r\nTiled floor and staircase to first floor. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 6.4m x 2.9m \r\nVinyl flooring, dual aspect, fully fitted Kitchen with free stand electric oven, stainless steel sink and Stanley range (no longer operational).\r\n\r\nRear corridor - 1.0m x 2.2m \r\nVinyl flooring and walk-in storage press.\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.8m x 1.7m \r\nVinyl flooring, rear door access to court yard, plumbed for appliances.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Shower Room & Inner Lobby - 2.3m x 2.3m \r\nVinyl flooring, frosted window, whb with vanity unit, wc, TritonT90 SR shower.  \n\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom 1 - 3.7m x 2.3m \r\nVinyl flooring, rear door access to courtyard and built-in storage.\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.0m x 0.75m \r\nCarpet stairway, stira to attic.\n\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 2.3m \r\nWood flooring, street aspect, built in wardrobes and storage.\r\n\r\nWC - 1.7m x 0.8m \r\nWood flooring, WC with vanity unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 2.6m \r\nWood flooring, built-in wardrobe and rear aspect. \r\n\r\nLock up store - 3.9m x 2.7m \r\nBlock built with concrete floor, electricity & galvanised steel roof.\r\n\r\nBlock built lean to store - 4.2m x 3.5m \r\nOil tank, concrete floor, gated pedestrian access onto rear laneway.  \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Short stroll to the town centre and all its amenities.\r\nLow maintenance site, with concrete courtyard to the rear and set down patio to the front.\r\nMix of double glazed pvc and single glazed teak windows. \r\nAll main services.\r\nSouth-east facing fully enclosed secure rear courtyard with ample storage.\r\nA wide variety of stunning beaches a short drive away including the seaside town of Ballybunion."
      },
      {
